    { name: "PolyTerra PLA", tier: "mid", verdict: "The best matte PLA available.", notes: "Matte finish eliminates the shiny look of standard PLA. Prints beautifully, good color range, cardboard spool. Slightly more brittle than Prusament but not a problem for most use cases." },
